# ---------------------------------------------------------------- credentialed data
# MIMIC-IV v3.1 is credentialed under the PhysioNet Data Use Agreement and must
# never be redistributed. Raw tables, any cohort built from them, and cached
# feature blocks all count. Aggregate results -- metric JSON and figures -- do
# not, and are committed on purpose, so `results/` is deliberately NOT ignored.
data/
